      "side": 1,
      "message": "What, if anything, gets exposed at My_Platform?  If it is nothing, are we ok with that?  Don\u0027t you generally at least want some way to debug by seeing your probe statements?  I\u0027m slightly surprised we\u0027re not introducing a Configuration.Platform or requiring a platform to have a Inventory.Decorator.Compatible or something to know it exists.",
