      "message": "\u003e I didn\u0027t add a PDI definition for it, because Probe\u0027s signature isn\u0027t stable, and these properties were never in a PDI contract anyway. Happy to add one if you\u0027d prefer.\n\nI would prefer we add a PDI definition for all EM configs, yes.  Especially if we can make it \"stable\".\n\nWhat did you mean by Probe\u0027s signature isn\u0027t stable?  Isn\u0027t it just a string?",
